---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TipJarCard from '../components/TipJarCard.astro';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard.astro';
import product from '../data/product.json';

const title = "A Letter from the Founder: Why GetNetWorthCalculator is 100% Free & Ad-Free";
const description = "A personal letter from Yash Jha on why this project was built without ads or data selling, and how you can support our independent server infrastructure with a small tip.";

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://getnetworthcalculator.com/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Founder Letter & Community Tip Jar",
      "item": "https://getnetworthcalculator.com/support"
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} slot="head" />

  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-12 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    
    <!-- Hero Letter Header -->
    <header class="text-center space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/15 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>💌</span>
        <span>An Open Letter from the Creator</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Why I Built 650+ Free Calculators — And Refused to Sell Out to Banks
      </h1>

      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        By the <strong>Solo Developer &amp; Modeler</strong>, GetNetWorthCalculator.com
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- The Personal Story (Heartfelt & Deeply Human) -->
    <article class="p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 via-orange-500 to-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-extrabold text-2xl shadow-md border-2 border-amber-400/40 shrink-0">
          💻
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Hi, I'm the Solo Developer behind NetWorth.</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Solo Builder &amp; Modeler of GetNetWorthCalculator.com</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        A while ago, I sat at my desk trying to answer what should have been a simple, honest question: 
        <em>"Where does my net worth actually stand compared to people my age?"</em>
      </p>

      <p>
        What I found genuinely disgusted me. 
        Virtually every top result on Google was owned by massive financial lead-generation conglomerates. Before they would show me a single chart, they demanded my phone number, my email, and forced me to connect my real bank accounts through third-party data brokers. Within 48 hours, my inbox was flooded with spam pushing 26.99% APR personal loans and high-fee credit cards.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Your net worth should be personal, private, and empowering — not a hunting ground for predatory lenders.</strong>
      </p>

      <p>
        So I decided to build the antidote. Over months of late nights and weekends, I wrote the code, scraped and cleaned thousands of microdata rows from the <strong>US Federal Reserve Board’s Survey of Consumer Finances (SCF)</strong>, and created <strong>650+ state, age, and milestone calculators</strong>.
      </p>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 dark:bg-emerald-950/30 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 space-y-2 my-4">
        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base">My 3 Golden Rules For This Website:</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          <li>🔒 <strong>100% Client-Side Privacy:</strong> Zero bank logins. Your financial figures stay in your browser and are never saved to any database.</li>
          <li>🚫 <strong>Zero Spammy Popups or Banner Ads:</strong> No blinking loan ads or autoplay videos stealing your focus.</li>
          <li>🆓 <strong>Always 100% Free:</strong> No features locked behind greedy $15/month subscription paywalls.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">Why I'm Asking For Your Help Today</h3>
      
      <p>
        Because I don't run ads or sell your financial data to banks, <strong>I make $0 from running this website</strong>. 
        Edge server hosting, Cloudflare routing, domain registrations, and continuous Federal Reserve microdata pipeline updates come out of my own personal savings every month.
      </p>

      <p>
        I want to keep this site alive, ad-free, and accessible to everyone in the world who is trying to get out of debt, budget smarter, or build long-term generational wealth.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- Main Interactive Tip Jar Card (Personal Founder Edition) -->
    <section aria-label="Community Tip Selection">
      <TipJarCard headline="If this tool gave you financial clarity today, consider chipping in a dollar." />
    </section>

    <!-- The Free Gift: Why Every Tip Gets The Master Vault -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <div class="text-center space-y-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 font-mono">The Fair Exchange</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">My Free Thank-You Gift To You</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          I don't expect charity with an empty hand. Whoever tips — whether it's $1, $3, or $10 — gets my complete offline financial system completely free.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ProductCard headline="The Master Wealth & 50/30/20 Budget Vault (Free for Whoever Tips)" />
    </section>

    <!-- Reassurance FAQ -->
    <section class="space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-center">Questions You Might Have</h3>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <details class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm list-none flex justify-between items-center">
            <span>"What if I genuinely cannot afford to tip right now?"</span>
            <span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Please do not feel pressured at all! I built these 650+ calculators so that anyone, regardless of income or financial situation, has access to clean, unbiased wealth benchmarks. The tools on this website will always stay 100% free for you. Focus on building your emergency savings first.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm list-none flex justify-between items-center">
            <span>"Is this completely safe? Will I be charged recurringly or enrolled in a subscription?"</span>
            <span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            <strong>100% Safe. It is strictly a ONE-TIME tip.</strong> There are absolutely zero recurring charges, zero hidden subscriptions, and zero accounts to create. All checkouts are processed directly through <strong>Buy Me a Coffee &amp; Stripe</strong> with bank-grade 256-bit SSL encryption (PCI-DSS Level 1 certified). We never see or store your payment details, and all tips are backed by a <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong>.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm list-none flex justify-between items-center">
            <span>"How do I receive the Master Wealth Vault?"</span>
            <span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Immediately after you tip (via Apple Pay, Google Pay, or Card), Buy Me a Coffee automatically unlocks the instant download link and sends a copy straight to your email with all Excel (.xlsx) and Google Sheets files.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm list-none flex justify-between items-center">
            <span>"Can I enter a custom amount?"</span>
            <span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Yes! Click the <strong>Custom $__</strong> button on the tip card, and you can type any dollar amount you want. Whether it's $1 for a coffee or $25 to help sponsor our monthly server bills, every single cent goes directly back into maintaining this free platform.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Return to Calculator -->
    <div class="text-center pt-4">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition-all shadow-md">
        <span>← Back to Net Worth Percentile Calculator</span>
      </a>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>
